{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_7","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"rg -n 'KIT COMPLETE|re-check-5|runtime-seeded|runtime.seed|instrument.shape' collab .agents .codex orchestrator-logs --glob '*.md'; rg -n 'run-main|exception|seed' test/yang/call/conformance.clj; rg --files test/yang | rg '(source_test|exception.*test)'; git log -5 --oneline; cat deps.edn | tail -85\"","aggregated_output":"rg: .agents: No such file or directory (os error 2)\nrg: .codex: No such file or directory (os error 2)\ncollab/exception-track/1794446270000-architect-php-r1r2r3-step7.gpt-6.1-sol.findings.md:185:### Shutdown/global release: prefer an instrument-shape repair\ncollab/exception-track/1794541429000-php-r1r2r3-round-record.md:50:   three payload-identity fixtures assume post-unit survival; sol's re-check-5 §4 prefers an\ncollab/exception-track/1794541429000-php-r1r2r3-round-record.md:51:   instrument-shape repair — the directed in-lane pins already prove the assertions pass with\ncollab/exception-track/1794541429000-php-r1r2r3-round-record.md:52:   a runtime-seeded payload). php's lifecycle rows stay red pending that change.\ncollab/exception-track/1794532719000-architect-step7-recheck6.gpt-6.1-sol.findings.md:195:coverage under the explicit re-check-5 ruling; they are not deleted. Near-max and 2^53\n9:   donor runtime's own entry (`js/run-main`, `php/run-main`, `py/run-main`,\n10:   `clj/run-main`), reads each named export from the donor runtime's global\n121:     `:run-main` entry takes;\n127:   - `:render`: the `:run-main` value as test data.\"\n134:    :run-main 'js/run-main,\n144:    :run-main 'php/run-main,\n156:    :run-main 'py/run-main,\n172:    :run-main 'clj/run-main,\n250:   (u/app (u/v (:run-main (profile frontend)))\n272:        {:keys [project parse unit run-main]} (profile caller-frontend)]\n283:                [(u/app (u/v run-main) (unit (parse caller-source) exports))])))))\n337:(defn compose-exception\n407:(defn guard-exceptions-form\n431:(defn exception-outcome\n432:  \"Uniform observation of a runtime root's output. Preserve its exception\n438:        [out exception result]\n440:          :python [(:py/out rendered) (:py/exception value) nil]\n447:    {:frontend frontend :out out :exception exception :value result\n451:(defn exception-call\n452:  \"The exception-leg counterpart of `call`, with uniform per-VM outcomes.\n458:      (run-program donor (compose-exception donor exports caller-frontend caller-source))\n459:      #(exception-outcome caller-frontend %))))\n468:(defn run-exception-program\n469:  \"The exception probes' independent VM runs, concurrent on the JVM. Each\ntest/yang/call/php_exception_test.clj\ntest/yang/call/exception_contract_test.clj\ntest/yang/call/python_exception_test.clj\ntest/yang/call/exception_source_test.clj\ntest/yang/php/antlr/exceptions_test.clj\ntest/yang/python/antlr/exception_call_test.clj\n6b5dfa7f test(exception-kit): retire Clojure finally refusal per owner ruling\n96633aaf docs(agents): add gemini-4-hydrogen to model selection guide\n5eaef15e merge: PHP R1+R2+R3 — the §8.10.7 boundary as one coherent round (r1-r12; deepseek-v4-pro round-7 sign-off; shiva acceptance 33 rows red->green, 3 disclosed lane-block residuals to the steward; chronology on jupiter; clojure-provenance rows inherited, not touched)\n20cb8d7d docs(collab): the PHP R1+R2+R3 round record — r1-r12 trail, shiva acceptance (33 rows red->green), reviewer re-routing, and the lane findings for the steward\n69b49636 docs(exception-track): node dht-import parity incident CLOSED — adoption caused, python re-mints resolved, not architectural; port merge notice gated on P1-1 only\n           ;; generated Java parser classes, no JS/Dart roots, and no\n           ;; dependency coordinate is fetched until a jolt-loaded namespace\n           ;; needs one.\n           :jolt {:replace-paths [\"src/jolt\" \"src/cljc\" \"src/clj\"]\n                  :replace-deps {}}\n           :jolt-yin-repl {:main-opts [\"-m\" \"yin.shell.main\"]}\n           ;; composed after :jolt (-M:jolt:jolt-test): the oracle tests and\n           ;; src/dev (src/dev/jolt_test_runner.clj and its sentinel)\n           :jolt-test {:extra-paths [\"test\" \"src/dev\"]}\n           ;; DIAGNOSTIC only (-M:jolt:jolt-diag:jolt-test): a jolt stand-in\n           ;; for the corpus loader dao.jing.cbor-fixtures, whose root must\n           ;; precede test (src/dev/jolt_diag/dao/jing/cbor_fixtures.cljc);\n           ;; jolt puts :extra-paths roots first, in alias order (-Spath)\n           :jolt-diag {:extra-paths [\"src/dev/jolt_diag\"]}\n           :cljs-yin-repl\n           {:extra-paths [\"test\" \"src/dev\"]\n            :extra-deps {thheller/shadow-cljs {:mvn/version \"3.3.5\"}\n                         reagent/reagent {:mvn/version \"2.0.1\"}\n                         com.cognitect/transit-cljs {:mvn/version \"0.8.280\"}}\n            :main-opts [\"-m\" \"yin.repl.node-runner\"]}\n           :fmt {:extra-paths [\"src/dev\"]\n                 :exec-fn tasks/fix-all}\n           ;; Build-time generation of the grammars-v4 Python3 parser.\n           ;; The tool version must equal the antlr4-runtime above.\n           :antlr-gen {:extra-paths [\"src/dev\"]\n                       :extra-deps {org.antlr/antlr4 {:mvn/version \"4.13.2\"}}\n                       :main-opts [\"-m\" \"yang-antlr-gen\"]}\n           :kondo {:extra-deps {clj-kondo/clj-kondo {:mvn/version \"2026.01.19\"}}\n                   :main-opts [\"-m\" \"clj-kondo.main\"]}\n           ;; Development/oracle only (datomic-q-v1 Client oracle runner,\n           ;; docs/design/dao.space.query.datomic-compat.md); never a production\n           ;; dependency. Backend deps/config are pinned separately once selected.\n           :oracle {:extra-paths [\"src/dev\" \"test\"]\n                    :extra-deps {com.datomic/client-api {:mvn/version \"1.0.69\"}\n                                 ;; oracle backend: Datomic Local, in-process,\n                                 ;; run in docker/oracle (dev-scope only)\n                                 com.datomic/local {:mvn/version \"1.0.301\"}}}\n           :dbg {:extra-paths [\"test\"]\n                 :main-opts [\"-m\" \"debug-cljd\"]\n                 :cljd/opts {:kind :flutter :main datomworld.demo.main}}\n           :cljd-yin-repl {:main-opts [\"-m\" \"yin.repl.runner\"]}\n           :cljd-yin-repl-build\n           {:main-opts  [\"-m\" \"cljd.build\"]\n            :cljd/opts  {:kind       :dart\n                         :main       yin.shell.main\n                         :output-dir \"build/yin-repl\"\n                         :output-to  \"build/yin-repl/yin_repl.dart\"}}\n           :dep-graph {:extra-paths [\"src/dev\"]\n                       :extra-deps {org.clojure/tools.namespace {:mvn/version \"1.5.0\"}}\n                       :main-opts [\"-m\" \"dep-graph\"]}}}\n\n\n;; clj -X:fmt\n\n;; clj -M:nREPL\n\n;; clj -M:nREPL:server\n;; clj -M:test\n;; clj -M:test -n yin.vm-literal-test\n;; clj -M:test -n yin.vm-continuation-test\n;; clj -M:test -n yin.repl.python-antlr-test\n;; clj -X:test :nses '[yin.vm-literal-test yin.vm-test]'\n;; clj -M:test -v yin.vm-addition-test/test-lambda-with-multiple-operations\n\n;; clj -X:clean\n\n;; npx shadow-cljs compile test && node target/node-tests.js\n;; npx shadow-cljs release demo\n;; clj -M:dev -m shadow.cljs.devtools.cli watch demo\n;; clj -M:cljs -m shadow.cljs.devtools.cli watch demo\n;; clj -M:cljs -m shadow.cljs.devtools.cli compile demo\n;; clj -M:cljs -m shadow.cljs.devtools.cli release demo\n\n\n;; mise exec -- clj -M:clojuredart:cljd watch \n;; mise exec -- flutter run \n\n;; To start the emulator:                                                                                              ;; emulator -avd Pixel_3_API_34\n;; flutter emulators --launch Pixel_3_API_34\n;; emulator -avd Pixel_3_API_34 -no-snapshot-load  \n;; emulator -list-avds\n\n;;  clj -M:dep-graph                    # full report + dep-graph.dot + dep-graph.svg\n;;  clj -M:dep-graph --filter \"yin.*\"   # only yin namespaces\n;;  clj -M:dep-graph --layout circo     # choose graphviz layout engine\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
